---
import { foods, pos, mid, formatPh } from '../data/foods';

const heroFoods = foods.filter((f) => f.hero);
const ticks = [2, 3, 4, 6, 7, 8, 9];
---

<figure class="ph" aria-labelledby="ph-caption">
  <div class="ph-scale">
    <ul class="ph-row top">
      {
        heroFoods
          .filter((f) => f.hero === 'top')
          .map((f) => (
            <li class:list={['ph-food', { 'desktop-only': !f.heroMobile, start: pos(mid(f)) < 8 }]} style={`--x:${pos(mid(f))}%`}>
              <span class="ph-name">{f.name}</span>
              <span class="ph-val">pH {formatPh(f.ph)}</span>
            </li>
          ))
      }
    </ul>
    <div class="ph-bar" role="img" aria-label="pH-Skala von 2, sehr sauer, bis 9, basisch. Markierung bei pH 5.">
      {
        ticks.map((t) => (
          <span class="ph-tick" style={`--x:${pos(t)}%`} aria-hidden="true">
            {t}
          </span>
        ))
      }
      <span class="ph-threshold" style={`--x:${pos(5)}%`} aria-hidden="true"><span>5</span></span>
    </div>
    <ul class="ph-row bottom">
      {
        heroFoods
          .filter((f) => f.hero === 'bottom')
          .map((f) => (
            <li class:list={['ph-food', { 'desktop-only': !f.heroMobile, start: pos(mid(f)) < 8 }]} style={`--x:${pos(mid(f))}%`}>
              <span class="ph-name">{f.name}</span>
              <span class="ph-val">pH {formatPh(f.ph)}</span>
            </li>
          ))
      }
    </ul>
  </div>
  <figcaption id="ph-caption">
    <span class="threshold-key" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    Unter pH 5 wird Pepsin, das sich beim stillen Reflux in der Halsschleimhaut festsetzt, deutlich aktiver. Darum
    beginnt die säurearme Reflux-Ernährung rechts dieser Linie.
    <a href="/ernaehrung/">Alle Lebensmittel im Check</a>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ph {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .ph-scale {
    padding-inline: 0.2rem;
  }
  .ph-row {
    position: relative;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    height: 3.4rem;
  }
  .ph-food {
    position: absolute;
    left: var(--x);
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.15;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .top .ph-food {
    bottom: 0;
  }
  .bottom .ph-food {
    top: 0;
  }
  .ph-food.start {
    transform: translateX(-0.5rem);
    align-items: flex-start;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .ph-food.start::after {
    margin-left: 0.4rem;
  }
  .ph-food::after {
    content: '';
    width: 2px;
    height: 0.8rem;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    background: currentColor;
    opacity: 0.55;
  }
  .bottom .ph-food::after {
    order: -1;
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
  }
  .ph-name {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }
  .ph-val {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    opacity: 0.82;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .ph-bar {
    position: relative;
    height: 2.6rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--ph-strip);
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.14),
      0 14px 28px -16px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.7);
  }
  .ph-tick {
    position: absolute;
    left: var(--x);
    top: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    font: 700 0.8rem/1 var(--font-body);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    color: rgb(0 0 0 / 0.55);
  }
  .ph-tick:first-child {
    transform: translate(10%, -50%);
  }
  .ph-tick:nth-last-child(2) {
    /* pH 9 am rechten Rand */
    transform: translate(-110%, -50%);
    color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.85);
  }
  .ph-threshold {
    position: absolute;
    left: var(--x);
    top: -0.7rem;
    bottom: -0.7rem;
    border-left: 2px dashed currentColor;
  }
  .ph-threshold span {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 0.3rem;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    font: 700 0.8rem/1 var(--font-body);
    color: rgb(0 0 0 / 0.6);
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
    max-width: 60ch;
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .threshold-key {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 1.4rem;
    border-top: 2px dashed currentColor;
    vertical-align: middle;
    margin-right: 0.35rem;
  }
  figcaption a {
    color: inherit;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  @media (max-width: 40rem) {
    .desktop-only {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
